<title>UK: Next to issue trading statement on Jan 13.</title>
<headline>Next to issue trading statement on Jan 13.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British clothes retailer Next Plc said on Thursday it plans to issue a trading statement on Monday, January 13.</p>
<p>The statement will outline sales for the 24-week period from July 28, 1996 to January 11, 1997, Next said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
